WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.738
"Hmm," Mrs. Tiggywinkle thought.

2
00:00:07.739 --> 00:00:13.719
She looked at Simpkin.

3
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:17.345
"We cannot finish the coat," she said.

4
00:00:17.346 --> 00:00:21.191
"So I will make a cake."

5
00:00:21.192 --> 00:00:25.408
"A cake?" Simpkin cried.

6
00:00:25.409 --> 00:00:28.722
He rubbed his belly.

7
00:00:28.723 --> 00:00:31.714
"Oh," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

8
00:00:31.715 --> 00:00:34.242
She made a sad face.

9
00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:36.560
"We have no flour.

10
00:00:36.561 --> 00:00:45.793
And the shop is closed today."

11
00:00:45.794 --> 00:00:51.715
Mopsy sighed. "No cake and no buttons."

12
00:00:51.716 --> 00:00:54.689
Suddenly Simpkin jumped up.

13
00:00:54.690 --> 00:00:58.052
"The shop is open!" he cried.

14
00:00:58.053 --> 00:01:06.105
"What?" Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

15
00:01:06.106 --> 00:01:11.874
"Here." Simpkin held out three gold buttons.

16
00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:14.337
"I was mad at the tailor.

17
00:01:14.338 --> 00:01:16.767
He ate my lunch!"

18
00:01:16.768 --> 00:01:19.994
Mrs. Tiggywinkle patted Simpkin.

19
00:01:19.995 --> 00:01:23.803
"It is hard to be hungry."

20
00:01:23.804 --> 00:01:28.026
Mrs. Tiggywinkle gave the buttons to the bunnies.

21
00:01:28.027 --> 00:01:30.925
Then she looked at Simpkin.

22
00:01:30.926 --> 00:01:33.869
"Go to the shop for some flour.

23
00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:46.965
We will sew and bake."

24
00:01:46.966 --> 00:01:50.698
Soon the coat was ready.

25
00:01:50.699 --> 00:01:57.229
"Beautiful!" Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

26
00:01:57.230 --> 00:02:00.259
Simpkin stared at the cake.

27
00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:05.817
"Beautiful!" he said.

28
00:02:05.818 --> 00:02:11.444
The tailor climbed out of bed.

29
00:02:11.445 --> 00:02:15.614
On the coat, three gold buttons shined.

30
00:02:15.615 --> 00:02:18.048
"Beautiful!" he said.

31
00:02:18.049 --> 00:02:41.360
"Thank you, bunnies!"

